FoodLog is a modified work based on Dime (https://github.com/rafsoh/dimeApp).

FoodLog modifications were created on 31 August 2026. The new application target
replaces expense transactions and budgets with a neutral food-journal experience.
It adds a FoodEntry data model, food/meal entry flow, search and filtering,
descriptive pattern summaries, CSV export, and a new app icon.

